// How many startup ticks are averaged away as the sensor's zero. Optional, and so is the section
// it sits in: a sensor already tared externally sets 0, and one that says nothing takes the
// default. Unlike an address or a baud rate, no connection depends on it, so a simulated
// deployment states it only when it wants a different number than the driven one would use.
